  "name": "League Champions & Rift Quality Pack / \u82f1\u96c4\u4e0e\u5ce1\u8c37\u54c1\u8d28\u5347\u7ea7",
  "author": "BoDUD",
  "version": "0.10.6",
  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-007 and 009 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, Xayah and Yone. Version 0.10.6 targets Teamfight Manager 2 base 0.5.1 and is a Yone visual rebuild; the Q/W/R gameplay and saved-season contract introduced in 0.10.5 is unchanged. Spirit Cleave scans one current GameCtx with no process-global ledger, hits each valid enemy once inside a true 80-degree, 42000-range cone, deals 35 + 45% Attack + 6% target maximum-health physical damage, and settles exactly one shield tier for zero through five champions hit. Mod API 0.8 cannot expose W-only attack-speed scaling, so cast time and cooldown remain fixed at 0.5 and 8 seconds. Retired E and 0.10.4 rectangular-W native names remain no-op load compatibility only: embedded old skill trees are not migrated, so the current W needs a save first created on 0.10.5 or later; a valid 0.10.5 W save can upgrade to 0.10.6 without being recreated. One new adult-proportioned ImageGen action contact is used only as Yone's unified identity source. The source-stage generator emits exactly 54 native-dimension RGBA body frames with hard alpha and at most 32 opaque colors, then the atlas builder copies those frames byte-for-byte without resize, crop, quantization, fallback art, or pack-time face synthesis. Idle[0]'s face is pixel-locked inside the native 43x55 frame. The real 141x138 card route is replayed with nearest-neighbor sampling, at least 6 pixels of clearance above the divider, and zero actor overlap with the UI-icon safe region. Normal battle, Ban/Pick and scoreboard rendering all read the actor idle route; this release does not depend on the default-disabled legacy base-0.5.0 client extension or independent UI portrait PNGs. The four superseded V3 body contacts and their processed derivatives are retired. Native actor rectangles, labels, timings and foot anchors remain unchanged.",
  "last_updated": "2026-07-19",
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "mod_id": "base",
      "version": ">=0.5.1"
    }
  ]
}
